    ["Ray from the phone company says the tower by the [water plant|silos] trips every time it hits 95"] = "电话公司的雷说[水厂|筒仓]旁边的信号塔一到95度就跳闸",
    ["Customer yelling about roaming charges again. [Send them to Dot|Give them a credit]. Not worth it"] = "又有顾客为漫游费大吼大叫。[把他们交给多特|给他们退点钱]。不值得",
    ["dads on the roof again with the antenna. says the tower comes in [clearer|better] up there. [typical|hes so proud]"] = "爸又爬到房顶上弄天线了。说那上面信号塔收得[更清楚|更好]。[真是他的作风|他可骄傲了]",
    ["lady at the IGA bought [three|four] car phones today. cash. said her kids [need them|wont answer the house phone]"] = "IGA的那位女士今天买了[三|四]部车载电话。付的现金。说她的孩子们[需要|不接家里的电话]",
    ["New test handsets came in. Sealed, no manuals. Ray says [don't sell them|don't open them] until corporate calls"] = "新的测试手机到了。密封的，没有说明书。雷说公司来电话之前[别卖|别拆]",
    ["coach added [saturday|sunday] practice. 6am at the field. [kill me|why does he hate us]"] = "教练加了[周六|周日]的训练。早上6点在球场。[杀了我吧|他为什么这么恨我们]",
    ["Your shift at Spiffo's starts at 4. Tammy called the house. Don't be late again"] = "你在Spiffo's的班4点开始。塔米打到家里了。别再迟到了",
    ["[jess|mike] saw [your crush|that senior] at the lumberyard buying a slushie. [just saying|ur welcome]"] = "[杰丝|迈克]看见[你暗恋的人|那个高年级的]在木材厂买冰沙。[我就说说|不用谢]",
    ["Mowed the path down to the river. Fireworks spot's ready. Bring [chairs|the blue cooler] Sunday"] = "把通往河边的小路割出来了。看烟花的地方弄好了。周日带[椅子|那个蓝色保温箱]",
    ["band practice moved to the gym cause of the heat. [hydrate or die|bring water] he says"] = "因为天热，乐队排练改到体育馆了。他说[不喝水就等死|带上水]",
    ["Grandma's [prescription|insulin] needs picking up before the Fourth. Today please"] = "七月四日之前得去取奶奶的[处方药|胰岛素]。今天去，拜托",
    ["twiggys has AC and cold cokes. meet in [10|15]? jimmy's working"] = "twiggys有空调和冰可乐。[10|15]分钟后见？吉米在",
    ["helicopters toward louisville all morning. [prob nothing|kinda freaking me out]"] = "直升机一上午都往路易斯维尔飞。[多半没事|有点吓到我了]",
    ["Your cousin [in Louisville|at the base] has the flu real bad. Aunt Carol says he won't eat"] = "你[在路易斯维尔的|在基地的]表哥得了很重的流感。卡罗尔姑妈说他不肯吃东西",
    ["got [two|three] spots for the river fireworks. [u drive|i drive]?"] = "弄到[两|三]个看河边烟花的位置。[你开车|我开车]？",
    ["Daycare closes at 5. [Can you get her|I'll get her] if you're stuck at {jobPlace}"] = "托儿所5点关门。如果你被困在{jobPlace}，[你能去接她吗|我去接她]",
    ["Camp drop-off at 7:30. [Pack the bug spray|Don't forget the inhaler]"] = "夏令营7点半送。[带上驱虫喷雾|别忘了吸入器]",
    ["Babysitter bailed for tonight. [Her mom fell|Her car died]. You free to swap?"] = "保姆今晚放鸽子了。[她妈妈摔倒了|她的车坏了]。你有空换班吗？",
    ["Taking the boys to Grandma's [Friday|Saturday]. Back roads are better with the trailer"] = "[周五|周六]带孩子们去奶奶家。拖着拖车走小路更好",
    ["Parade's at 10 on the Fourth. Bring the wagon. The little one won't walk that far"] = "七月四日游行10点开始。带上小推车。小的走不了那么远",
    ["Grocery list: juice boxes, [diapers size 4|baby wipes], and whatever cereal is on sale"] = "购物清单：果汁盒，[4号尿布|婴儿湿巾]，还有打折的随便什么麦片",
    ["My kid has the flu everybody's getting. [High fever|Won't eat]. Keep yours home from camp"] = "我家孩子得了大家都在得的流感。[高烧|不肯吃东西]。你家的别送去夏令营",
    ["Need someone on [grill|fryer] tomorrow 6 to 2. Text back by noon"] = "明天6点到2点需要有人上[烤架|炸锅]。中午前回短信",
    ["Night shift is short two. Can you do 10 to 6? [Overtime|Time and a half]"] = "夜班缺两个人。你能上10点到6点吗？[加班费|一点五倍工资]",
    ["Front desk needs covering [Saturday|Sunday] 3 to 11. Same as last time"] = "[周六|周日]3点到11点前台需要人顶。和上次一样",
    ["You got swapped. You're on [Wednesday|Thursday] 7 to 3 now. Check the board"] = "你被换班了。现在是[周三|周四]7点到3点。看看公告板",
    ["Truck's at 6am. Pallets by the dock. [Bring gloves|Wear real shoes this time]"] = "早上6点卡车到。托盘在码头边。[带手套|这次穿双像样的鞋]",
    ["Delivery truck broke down. No deliveries till Tuesday. Keep your tips"] = "送货卡车坏了。周二前没有送货。小费你留着",
    ["[Rent|The mortgage] is due Friday. [Can you cover half|I've got it this month]"] = "[房租|房贷]周五到期。[你能出一半吗|这个月我来]",
    ["Kids need [shoes|school supplies] before August. There's a sale Saturday"] = "八月前孩子们需要[鞋|学习用品]。周六有打折",
    ["truck wont start. [prob the battery|my dad says its the starter]. can u come get me"] = "卡车打不着火。[多半是电池|我爸说是启动机]。你能来接我吗",
    ["Left you a plate in the oven. [Working late again?|I'm going to bed]"] = "给你在烤箱里留了一盘饭。[又加班吗？|我去睡了]",
