    ["The water heater's making that noise. Landlord says [$200|next week]. Of course he does"] = "热水器又在发那种响声。房东说[$200|下周]。他当然这么说",
    ["got [fired|laid off] today. dont tell my mom yet"] = "今天被[开除|裁员]了。先别告诉我妈",
    ["Baby won't sleep. Been up since 3. [Your turn tonight|I love you but your turn tonight]"] = "宝宝不睡。从3点起就没睡。[今晚轮到你|我爱你，但今晚轮到你]",
    ["Softball Saturday. They asked if you're playing. [Say yes|I said yes]"] = "周六垒球赛。他们问你打不打。[说打|我说你打了]",
    ["i still owe u [$20|$35] from the fair. ill drop it by friday. probably"] = "我还欠你[$20|$35]，是游乐会那次的。周五前给你送去。大概吧",
    ["told ur mom u were at my place when she called. [u owe me|cover me next time]"] = "你妈打电话来的时候我说你在我家。[你欠我一次|下次你替我掩护]",
    ["wedding's in 3 weeks. u still have to pick up the [cufflinks|tie clips]. tuesday?"] = "婚礼还有3周。你还得去取[袖扣|领带夹]。周二？",
    ["dad asked why the [truck|mower] smells like burnt oil. [i said it was me|i blamed the heat]. u owe me"] = "我爸问[卡车|割草机]怎么有股烧机油的味儿。[我说是我弄的|我怪到天热上了]。你欠我的",
    ["[travis|bobby] bet me [$10|a six pack] u wont ask her out. prove him wrong saturday"] = "[特拉维斯|鲍比]跟我赌[$10|一提啤酒]你不敢约她。周六证明他错了",
    ["mom found out u still have her casserole dish from easter. she wants it back sunday"] = "妈发现复活节那个砂锅盘还在你那儿。她要你周日还回来",
    ["river's up past the bridge. [too high to swim|perfect for tubing]. [wanna check after work|forget it]"] = "河水涨过桥了。[太高了不能游泳|正好漂流]。[下班后去看看吗|算了]",
    ["amusement park friday. meet [at the gate|by the big coaster] around 6"] = "周五去游乐园。大概6点在[大门口|大过山车旁]碰头",
    ["The 18 bus is running late again. Wait at the shelter and I'll come get you"] = "18路公交又晚点了。在候车亭等着，我去接你",
    ["AC died in the apartment. Maintenance says Tuesday. [Fan in the window|We're sleeping on the floor] tonight"] = "公寓空调坏了。维修说周二。今晚[窗户上放个风扇|我们睡地板]",
    ["Traffic's backed up to Spaghetti Junction. [Take the Watterson|Go around] if you're coming over"] = "堵车堵到斯帕格蒂枢纽了。你要过来的话[走沃特森路|绕路]",
    ["tony gets off at 11. free slice if u come by the pizza place"] = "托尼11点下班。来披萨店的话送一块",
    ["The ferry runs [every hour|on the half hour] till 8. Get the mail on your way back"] = "渡轮到8点前[每小时|每半小时]一班。回来的路上顺便取下信",
    ["Hardware at the Pondview has [charcoal|propane] on sale. Grab two before Sunday"] = "庞德维尤的五金店[木炭|丙烷]在打折。周日前拿两个",
    ["lake house key is under the mat like always. fan works in the back bedroom"] = "湖边房子的钥匙还是在垫子下面。后卧室的风扇能转",
    ["The low water crossing washed out again. Take 31W home"] = "低水位渡口又被冲垮了。走31W回家",
    ["Grandma's [tomatoes|peppers] came in early. Come for supper Wednesday and take a basket"] = "奶奶的[西红柿|辣椒]熟得早。周三来吃晚饭，带一篮子回去",
    ["bonfire at the point friday. [bring wood|grab ice]. somebody's bringing a truck with speakers"] = "周五在岬角篝火晚会。[带木柴|拿点冰]。有人会开辆带音响的卡车来",
    ["Phone bill was [$198|$203]. Long distance to Louisville is killing us"] = "电话账单是[$198|$203]。打路易斯维尔的长途要把我们压垮了",
