    ["Mrs. Higgins ran up 400 minutes again. She's lonely, hon. [Waive the late fee|Give her a credit]"] = "希金斯太太又打了400分钟。她孤单，亲爱的。[免掉滞纳金|给她退点钱]",
    ["Ray says the site by the river dropped again. He'll look at it [tomorrow|Monday]. Can you cover the 2 o'clock?"] = "雷说河边那个基站又掉线了。他[明天|周一]去看。你能顶2点那班吗？",
    ["summer school starts monday. coach still making us run laps at 7am. [kill me|why]"] = "暑期班周一开课。教练还是让我们早上7点跑圈。[杀了我吧|为什么]",
    ["Summer school is still on. Pack a lunch. The blue thermos, not the leaky one"] = "暑期班还照常。带午饭。用蓝色保温壶，别用漏的那个",
    ["no shorts in summer school he says. even when its 95. the AC's broken anyway"] = "他说暑期班不许穿短裤。哪怕95度。反正空调也坏了",
    ["The janitor left the side door unlocked again. Nobody says anything. He's been there 30 years"] = "看门的又把侧门开着没锁。谁也不说什么。他在这儿三十年了",
    ["travis got detention the first day. [talked back|threw an eraser]. classic"] = "特拉维斯第一天就被留堂了。[顶嘴了|扔了黑板擦]。老样子",
    ["the cafeteria lady still makes those rolls. only good thing about summer school"] = "食堂阿姨还是做那种面包卷。暑期班唯一的好处",
    ["tips were [$12|$8] tonight. the grill guy burned three tickets. [never again|same as always]"] = "今晚小费[$12|$8]。烤架那家伙烧了三张单子。[再也不干了|跟平常一样]",
    ["The fryer's making that sound again. The boss says order the part. [I'm off at 10|Home by 11]"] = "炸锅又发那个声音了。老板说订零件。[我10点下班|11点前到家]",
    ["Heard the diner closed early tonight. Did you get home all right?"] = "听说餐馆今晚提前关门了。你平安到家了吗？",
    ["Your truck still at the shop? Let me know when it's ready and I'll drive you"] = "你的卡车还在修理厂吗？修好了告诉我，我开车送你",
    ["the regulars asked for u again. one old guy tipped [double|a quarter]. whatever"] = "熟客又点名要你。有个老头给了[双倍|二十五美分]小费。随便吧",
    ["Schedule's posted. You're on [grill|register] [Tue-Thu|Fri-Sun]"] = "排班表贴出来了。你[周二到周四|周五到周日]上[烤架|收银台]",
    ["mechanic says the [transmission|starter] is shot. [$400|$600] if the part ever comes in"] = "技工说[变速箱|启动机]报废了。零件要是到了，[$400|$600]",
    ["Register was [$14|$22] short. Had to count it three times. Long night"] = "收银机少了[$14|$22]。数了三遍。漫长的一夜",
    ["Food truck didn't show. No [burgers|chicken] for lunch. Improvise or close early"] = "送餐卡车没来。午饭没有[汉堡|炸鸡]。自己想办法或者提前关门",
    ["Marcus called. They're holding everyone on 12s. [Don't wait up|Save me a plate] he says"] = "马库斯打电话来了。他们让所有人连上12小时的班。他说[别等我|给我留一份饭]",
    ["Danny texted from the base. Just said pray for him, Mom. He sounds so tired"] = "丹尼从基地发来短信。只说为他祈祷吧，妈妈。他听起来好累",
    ["heard the base stopped all leave. my cousins husband hasnt called since yesterday"] = "听说基地停了所有休假。我表姐的丈夫从昨天起就没打过电话",
    ["dad's at the checkpoint per his last text. mom's baking again. [we're out of flour|tell her im ok]"] = "爸的上一条短信说他在检查站。妈又在烤东西了。[我们没面粉了|告诉她我没事]",
    ["The dog won't come in. Been at the screen door since dark, whining at nothing"] = "狗不肯进来。天黑以后一直趴在纱门边，对着空气呜呜叫",
    ["the neighbors cat showed up on our porch. no collar. [feeding it|let it in] for now"] = "邻居的猫跑到我们门廊上了。没有项圈。暂时[喂着它|让它进来]",
    ["Chickens stopped laying. [Three days|A week] now. Feed's fine. Coop's clean. I don't get it"] = "鸡不下蛋了。已经[三天|一周]了。饲料没问题。鸡舍干净。我不明白",
    ["saw a dog on 31W just sitting in the road. [couldnt catch it|it wouldnt come]"] = "在31W上看见一条狗就坐在路中间。[抓不住它|它不肯过来]",
    ["Coyotes by the barn last night. Fired in the air. Dog wouldn't quit shaking"] = "昨晚谷仓边有郊狼。朝天开了枪。狗一直抖个不停",
